    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasn't just once. it feels like it's part of who i am. i look in the mirror and i don't see someone who's \"compassionate,\" i just see someone who's selfish. someone who lets things happen. it's like i'm just taking up space that could belong to someone who actually deserves to be here.",
